#: scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdfcb9d4267571ee493b657093a345de1cc37a1dee0c2a851a4dff57ddcf24dd
#. default-sha256: aa8d54f8f3513e17e6104de376a6b63192590f98c3fb8f5d77a58305733db40d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“The mansion had an alluring air of beauty about it in that era;⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫it was "
"almost like something out of a fairy tale.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“In quell’epoca, la villa sprigionava un’affascinante aria di bellezza;⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫"
"sembrava uscita da una fiaba.”"

#: scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 735bb05a80ae988682f929a696bbef9a5bf6f31b6f61c301fdb65e18d9989e01
#. default-sha256: 690f67be6c17eb662ba14d12edefcf0533ee7432b0e15a33f4e3ca58c067824a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This period of history could perhaps be described as a symphony of destruction, as "
"cumbersome principles of old came crashing down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Questo periodo storico potrebbe essere descritto come una sinfonia⟪k:2⟫di distruzione, "
"dove i vecchi princìpi andavano ad infrangersi."

#: scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18fac8f3b916e67f984d8679f53e8289526376fb59ea0451f763ae75356cac56
#. default-sha256: f2f7f824b36b4a2d19afd49b8bde7706882adfce0367935bb2e56c3f935a98df
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Freed from the day-to-day oppression of these antiquated precepts, the people seemed to hark "
"back to the more poetic, expressive ways of old."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Liberato dall’oppressione quotidiana di quei precetti antiquati,⟪k:1⟫il popolo sembrò "
"ritornare alle correnti del passato, più poetiche⟪k:2⟫ed espressive."

#: scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4bae95694a00c498591c12a25364c5af281f1e6e76eee6e9c444b41c4f3c72b
#. default-sha256: 83b644152ee1a0a28bdf67a7e4281e1822bc24283f17a738fe452eede466ab39
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They took these newly blossoming emotions in hand, and with them they wrote literature, "
"painted portraits, composed theatre, and found love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Presero in mano queste emozioni appena sbocciate, e grazie ad esse scrissero libri, "
"dipinsero ritratti, composero tragedie, e trovarono l’amore."

#: scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed03cf4e7d12c8cfb8c0994addbe564c189d930f4d46dd9018c4423a80216ffb
#. default-sha256: 23a77f614896abe31411d31146662b74500c88be6dc7dd42852188678800a96f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the Church, which had maintained authority throughout the Middle Ages, embraced the "
"changing times, adopting the culture’s flowering sense of aesthetic."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche la Chiesa, la quale aveva mantenuto l’autorità durante tutto il Medioevo, si adattò al "
"cambio dei tempi, accogliendo il fiorente senso estetico della cultura."

#: scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 785edef8053535d3ab77aab970ae51d6ff15b252ca90aae810635b7f90afc94e
#. default-sha256: 47c11e258a661c3311bc0dbe7f750df26bb42b68f65affeb063520cd2a4f42e8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫War would break out not twenty years from then, plucking the ripened era from the tree of "
"history—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but that is of no concern to us now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La guerra non sarebbe scoppiata che vent’anni dopo, strappando l’era maturata dall’albero "
"della storia—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma questo per ora non ci interessa."

#: scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b857650d58497cf843c584529214f93e29e4a190d9a97811e151638f867405f7
#. default-sha256: 94fe209a738de4050a40398e2835c1738130bbb88ac1bccf363ddad63e62e1b0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, it was still what people refer to as the Golden Age, a period of furor for all "
"who were there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’epoca che stiamo per osservare è ciò a cui la gente si riferisce con⟪k:1⟫“Età dell’Oro”, "
"un periodo di furore per tutti coloro che lo vissero."

#: scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0201e7de4c30776215baaaef6015496b9195e9624f08405b5ca47bc57997ba20
#. default-sha256: 40a48f3b9a496aace17256a3c09e1c474561ab1fc10cd0319e8682c970c9ebd1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Now, let us take a slight detour."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Facciamo ora una piccola deviazione."

#: scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e7316a35a0c5057e4c3af46c7b27bfd30ec7d8be9b9693aa037c08f31821f0c
#. default-sha256: 0c7b7d782e76ba2829c4b3c4d5fbf51b15fdd4d417f9b5298554dfafa112a20c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, we will not be changing locations—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is a tale about the mansion, from "
"beginning to end. ⟪k:3⟫We ⟪k:4⟫will⟪k:5⟫, however, be moving through time. ⟪k:6⟫Say... ⟪k:7⟫about "
"eight years into the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, non cambieremo luogo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫questa è una storia sulla villa,⟪k:3⟫dall’inizio alla "
"fine. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Tuttavia⟪k:6⟫, ci muoveremo nel tempo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Diciamo... ⟪k:9⟫di circa otto "
"anni nel passato."

#: scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79e9387832b77d978c8fa4ecc20b8c26dee077c015b577c9b5bcf9ee1d39a86b
#. default-sha256: e3238b2011124533bc530a0a917c521e36b9b05640b79d91d5ae87e4bd028dbd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A very wealthy family lived in the house then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫In quell’epoca, la casa era abitata da una famiglia molto ricca."

#: scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c13be3fbcbb976f17890e2cfabf2c9c796df28f34897852c4f52f304ec9a5c54
#. default-sha256: 9f5d73b281565dfcd8af1f120daf9924a1c85b4b862b9b5aed5585035d13119b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mother and father, brother and sister all had distinctive, beautiful flaxen hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La madre, il padre, il fratello e la sorella avevano tutti dei caratteristici, splendidi "
"capelli dorati."

#: scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd6d8031de34e11c5ed084e856003a57c5af55a59dc4329bdb0a922bd8cd3894
#. default-sha256: e02d1f43458d65266d25e6f05a9f0367c57dbfcb2ed084b36eba441697e5fa09
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was always enamored by their hair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By contrast, mine is the color of a wet crow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho sempre amato i loro capelli.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Al contrario, i miei hanno il colore di un corvo."

#: scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1f6802fe3c8fbf56c44184ac789e9290ee3a1de00e73a6cb4512c2722c790d3
#. default-sha256: 608107587c017690eec389b1ad93ee6585a85107f14108390829b903f31df3d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See? There I am, standing around, looking rather a fool."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vede? Eccomi lì, in piedi, con un aspetto alquanto sciocco."

#: scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a246b6f2ae087a56a69c04e5f2bd9bf67ec9266f657704e88628f15316238de
#. default-sha256: eb8f3a79db5bbe4cd852c120b10ea00a37120528f535fbf55da70c0ae42d6f00
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was happy back then. ⟪k:1⟫And what reason did I have not to be, afforded the opportunity "
"to attend to such a beautiful home?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero felice, allora. ⟪k:1⟫E quale motivo avrei dovuto avere per non esserlo, vista "
"l’opportunità di potermi occupare di una casa tanto bella?"

#: scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f46c47a9c050b07fbd718b881c17af88bfb1988ad91ab095518f4bb631df06ea
#. default-sha256: 4903d5f43b781dad8174455b9d3691c36c5f64000a8bbc393a9ccaf07cd61f8d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I poured my heart into serving that family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Così, misi anima e corpo nel servire quella famiglia."

#: scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 812a46cc742e392b99de34fc0f3ee8abc235b53c2c69d2eccc4a5bc6ee2b2403
#. default-sha256: 9b1028d73eba753bb46078a327f772c5b60054a19a7cb22693794da5883aee2a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Listen closely, if you would. ⟪k:1⟫That soft, fleeting sound that could only be a young "
"girl singing—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫can you hear it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Ascolti attentamente, se può. ⟪k:1⟫Riesce a sentirlo?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quel suono soffice e "
"fugace che poteva essere solamente il canto di una giovane ragazza..."

#: scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7467998e27d10070241ffd4b2ec71c5c0775da263ad6973f1cca659d16bc4537
#. default-sha256: fb8ee8855502daa9c2724f75d129000893665a3ed53380bd1165a01173c86bb4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."

#: scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d0a1dd2df574dc02c325420f286833d54bc02565986c3fa86e89fd019b367d4
#. default-sha256: 1e6581f2527b0eb8c4d4d2ff36070fc97704f97a6db114fdda3df8705abc072c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl you see, cheerfully picking crimson roses and singing like a songbird, was called "
"Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La ragazza che sta vedendo, intenta a raccogliere rose cremisi cantando allegramente come un "
"usignolo, si chiamava Nellie."

#: scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1eb7b36889b3755c8640a900a7c52e85840e5ed4c78c05509128f02cdc4b6b6
#. default-sha256: fc8fdf1ee434b52176f56edd5c2be6cd3b8e54083e9f3923d9cbf2106992f8d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though young, she sang with elegance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sebbene fosse giovane, cantava con eleganza."

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e3af72c4e8f7095ee5529079acaef86e6a82e67cfc1a3ec9b02d56e3d8e8e7e
#. default-sha256: f0fe3abd23881ba6e3c0fe2e31d722b52272ef0c5a2633cf2b22d95714311952
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was deeply fond of the house’s garden, and she would often spend her afternoons there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie era profondamente affezionata al giardino della villa,⟪k:1⟫e spesso vi trascorreva "
"interi pomeriggi."

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2aa1c7121a6c40eeac4ee12f34a268eaa0f5ad6c33237f78039719689eaa4bc6
#. default-sha256: 8eb37f88366ce01d90d75f61bf11ac55c4ce0a31f8a757026ab4fca523b78b30
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gorgeous roses gathered from all across the world bloomed in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nel giardino fiorivano splendide rose raccolte da tutto il mondo."

#: scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6053bb047520e3175404330f65369a026817394205b1bf7cc8b1748be4d1813d
#. default-sha256: 2433f970c0481b2f544d2672fde192cd2a4bfd05ea450786770ffcb2d6a78ff7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were given the utmost care, and even had their thorns removed—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ricevevano la massima cura, e venivano rimosse loro anche le spine—"

#: scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21f33b5d2cd2502c71ef1b4bb2e02128e8ddeb7917449bf5473d03c9464aad92
#. default-sha256: abd523c1b65dca99990ef331bf939188ab0da575af8f3340a64761a7de477320
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so young Nellie would not hurt herself, naturally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫cosicché la giovane Nellie non si facesse male, naturalmente."

#: scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8274426c69f80f75203b6bbb38d424e87f20bd98deb7b44d277012fe3b5cf6b7
#. default-sha256: 64e819632e9f8bedb145a55adc76986846c4c43d1bede63750556d3e691e1852
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The light-brown-haired girl carefully plucked petals from the roses, gathering them up as "
"she sang."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La ragazza dai capelli biondi strappò delicatamente i petali dalle rose, radunandoli mentre "
"cantava."

#: scenario:scenario_06BC61C6_E389_43D4_8C67_096FB58E00E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1e899f1e7b7851251a37488def8f1a71494c7139ae361c95a24bfd42da72edc
#. default-sha256: 99c1144cbcb90180b52ecfcb8255258bcee473f9eb12e4d31388f551bbf11f6c
