msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Little bird, little bird, singing night and day.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For your little birdy heart, "
"sing your woes away.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Pretty flowers all around, all around the little birds.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Passerotto, passerotto, giorno e notte canterai.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Con la forza della voce, "
"tutti i mali scaccerai.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Stupendi fiorellini, tutti intorno agli uccellini.⟪k:6⟫"

