msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD482BA8_A73A_4792_99CF_38E3C49F8D14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was, as a matter of fact, not the only visitor to the rose garden that day. ⟪k:1⟫She "
"always came with her older brother, Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie, in realtà, non era l’unica visitatrice del roseto quel giorno. ⟪k:1⟫Veniva sempre "
"con suo fratello maggiore, Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_7A9E35EF_61A0_4E46_A820_3FB9C3BD4276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba4787c966931dbaa0aceec39cd594d5c2c2796594cb347a8f066fb99136146b
