msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7A9E35EF_61A0_4E46_A820_3FB9C3BD4276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The young siblings were inseparable. ⟪k:1⟫Mell adored his little sister, who in turn pined "
"for his attention."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I due giovani fratelli erano inseparabili. ⟪k:1⟫Mell adorava sua sorella,⟪k:2⟫la quale a sua "
"volta si struggeva pur di attirare la sua attenzione."

#: scenario:scenario_6297F308_1089_41ED_B599_88622EEB5CFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb634c42f3a26ad15e58b4fb7b4b6a099ae2f48ef0e8899dc34f3d6392063ca1
