msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6297F308_1089_41ED_B599_88622EEB5CFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of the two innocent children cuddling together—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫not yet shackled by fear "
"for the future—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was truly heartwarming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La vista dei due bambini innocenti che si abbracciavano—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non ancora impauriti dal "
"futuro—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫era davvero commovente."

#: scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc70427c8e2e26f2360d4cb6c553928858c472bc7e694ae386f743962d74567a
#. default-sha256: 501066d25b2d3daee0ccf31296997c62c264cc7fa6c3e2f2ae157935769e7892
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day, Mell was sitting in the shade of a tree reading a book. ⟪k:1⟫As I am sure you are "
"aware, in their time, books could not yet be mass produced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quel giorno Mell era seduto all’ombra di un albero a leggere un libro. ⟪k:1⟫Come sono sicura "
"lei sappia, a quel tempo, i libri non potevano ancora essere prodotti in serie."

#: scenario:scenario_5FA5021E_D160_466F_8EB1_C05FDA1A31C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 067d07a1d83bb7fcc900f973fa7e58a318099d05b32b0d9bffd83a7c75fba114
