msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2D9E3BC0_0854_4F34_ABE7_A93B23D50558"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The book, having passed through many hands over many years, was visibly worn—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but I "
"suppose that just speaks to its importance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il libro, che aveva avuto molti proprietari nel corso degli anni,⟪k:1⟫era visibilmente "
"consumato—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ma suppongo che questo sottolinei⟪k:4⟫la sua importanza."

#: scenario:scenario_7F307564_3320_4CED_BC5E_3668C2A6DAEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 867a88784ecb1cb5650c7f0a48d42caf1cea3eddbf8ba99333682577682646b3
