msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell was a clever boy. ⟪k:1⟫He had attended church from a very young age, where a priest "
"would instruct him in Latin grammar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell era un ragazzo intelligente. ⟪k:1⟫Aveva iniziato, sin dalla tenera età,⟪k:2⟫a "
"frequentare la chiesa, dove un prete gli insegnava il latino."

#: scenario:scenario_4B1407FC_77A8_4A4B_995D_9B1FDDB3075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7168a3a222efbc27dc5b3dce5548b397dfd96b00589da25bc70f99bbf320bde
