msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ colpa tua, caro Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ho provato⟪k:7⟫ ad attirare la tua "
